			"id":"da1dbc2bf0004d36",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Rewards\n\n- Gives access to the [[Secret Garden.canvas|Secret Garden]]\n- You can reveal the [[045 - Antechamber.canvas|045 - Antechamber]] West Door Lever by changing the cardinal arrows on the water fountain arrows.\n- This room has a breakable wall that can be broken through the use of [[Power Hammer.canvas|Power Hammer]].\n\t- This unlocks another valve that can be used to reveal three key points in this room:\n\t\t- [[045 - Antechamber.canvas|045 - Antechamber]] East Door Lever\n\t\t- [[Moon Relic.canvas|Moon Relic]]\n\t\t- Orinda Aries [[Discover all Sigils.canvas|Sigil]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-960,
			"y":-760,
			"width":740,
			"height":380
		},
		{
			"id":"5b18a331b7422737",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"You might find a [[Secret Garden Key.canvas|Secret Garden Key]] during a run, when opening a locked door that is on the [[West Wing.canvas|West Wing]] or [[East Wing.canvas|East Wing]] using this key, it will bring you to the [[Secret Garden.canvas|Secret Garden]].",
